<title>INDIA: Indian cotton prices unchanged in dull trade.</title>
<headline>Indian cotton prices unchanged in dull trade.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cotton prices remained unchanged in lacklustre trade on Friday in the absence of buying from mills, traders said.</p>
<p>In spot Bengal deshi was steady at 860/890 rupees per maund (37.32 kg). Punjab saw-ginned was quoted at 1,560/1,590 rupees per maund.</p>
<p>Gujarat Kalyan was steady at 13,200 rupees per candy (355.56 kgs). Gujarat wagad was quoted at 12,600 rupees per candy.</p>
<p>-Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
